cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Controlli: quality-control reports and non-conformities of a production laboratory (db, 1997–1999)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Controlli records the quality-control reports of the production laboratory. Each report refers to a product, code, production order, thickness, dimensions, quantity and customer, with the customer and product specifications, and records the outcome of up to twenty checks and the related non-conformities. The application counts reports with and without non-conformities, and lists them by customer, product, code and order over a chosen period."
authors:
